<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: IRELAND GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>IRELAND GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>IRELAND GOVERNMENT LIST (970626)</p>
<p>President (Sworn in 3 Dec 90)...Mary ROBINSON</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>COALITION GOVERNMENT (Formed 26 June 97) Prime Minister (Taoiseach).......Bertie AHERN</p>
<p>Deputy Prime Minister.............Mary HARNEY</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Enterprise &amp; Employment)</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS</p>
<p>Agriculture, Food, Forestry.........Joe WALSH</p>
<p>Arts, Culture, Gaeltacht (Irish)..............Sile DE VALERA</p>
<p>Defence..........David ANDREWS</p>
<p>Education.......Michael MARTIN</p>
<p>Enterprise &amp; Employment............See Deputy Prime Minister</p>
<p>Environment.......Noel DEMPSEY</p>
<p>Finance.......Charlie McCREEVY</p>
<p>Foreign Affairs......Ray BURKE</p>
<p>Health.............Brian COWAN</p>
<p>Justice, Equality, Law Reform.John O'DONOGHUE</p>
<p>Marine...........Michael WOODS</p>
<p>Social Welfare....Dermot AHERN</p>
<p>Tourism, Trade......Jim McDAID</p>
<p>Transport, Energy, Telecommunications..........Mary O'ROURKE</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Parliament Speaker................Sean TREACY</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
<p>Central Bank Governor.......Maurice O'CONNELL</p>
<p>			    - - - - - - -</p>
